{"title":"Engineering scholarships","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The following list of <b>engineering scholarships</b> is primarily for American <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Engineering\" title=\"Engineering\">engineering</a> students.  This list can be reorganized to incorporate scholarship programs in other countries.  Just make that reorganization as clear and as clean as possible.\n</p><p>Additions to this list are welcomed and encouraged.  Please don't be stingy about letting students in on how they can finance their educations!  If you are unfamiliar with how to edit a Wiki and don't have time to learn, please contact <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathew_Crawford\" title=\"Mathew Crawford\">Mathew Crawford</a> using the email crawford@artofproblemsolving.com with the scholarship listing you wish to contribute.\n</p><p>Note that some <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Computer_science_and_technology_scholarships\" title=\"Computer science and technology scholarships\">computer science and technology scholarships</a> are probably suitable for engineering students and some scholarships below are also listed on that page.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#National_engineering_scholarships\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">National engineering scholarships</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Scholarship_programs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Scholarship programs</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Minority-specific_scholarships\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Minority-specific scholarships</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Graduate_school_scholarships_and_fellowship_programs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Graduate school scholarships and fellowship programs</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"National_engineering_scholarships\">National engineering scholarships</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Engineering_scholarships&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: National engineering scholarships\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Scholarship_programs\">Scholarship programs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Engineering_scholarships&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Scholarship programs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>American Institute of Chemical Engineers <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.aiche.org/Students/Scholarships/index.aspx\">scholarships</a></li>\n<li>American Nuclear Society <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ans.org/honors/scholarships/\">scholarships</a></li>\n<li>American Society for Heating, Refrigerating and Air-Conditioning Engineers <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ashrae.org/students/page/704\">Scholarships and Grants</a></li>\n<li>American Society for Mechanical Engineers <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.asme.org/Education/College/FinancialAid/Scholarships.cfm\">scholarships</a></li>\n<li>American Society of Naval Engineers <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.navalengineers.org/awards/scholarships/Pages/ASNELandingPage.aspx\">scholarships</a></li>\n<li>Association for Iron &amp; Steel Technology <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.aistfoundation.org/scholarships/scholarships.htm\">Scholarships</a></li>\n<li>SAE Engineering <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://students.sae.org/awdscholar/scholarships/engscholar/\">scholarships</a></li>\n<li>National Society of Professional Engineers <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.nspe.org/Students/Resources/index.html\">scholarships and fellowships</a>.</li>\n<li>Wire Reinforcement Institute  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.wirereinforcementinstitute.org/\">scholarships</a> of up to &lt;dollar/&gt;10,000.</li>\n<li>EngineerGirl essay contest (male students can enter too) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.engineergirl.org/CMS/Contest.aspx\">website</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.nasf.org/Content/NavigationMenu/AESFFoundation/ScholarshipInformation/default.htm\">American Electroplaters and Surface Finishers Society Scholarship</a> of &lt;dollar/&gt;1,500 for undergraduate and graduate students in chemistry and some types of engineering.</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.usacargotrailersales.com/2020-usa-cargo-trailer-scholarship\">USA Cargo Trailer Scholarship</a> of $1,500 for students pursuing engineering.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Minority-specific_scholarships\">Minority-specific scholarships</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Engineering_scholarships&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Minority-specific scholarships\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Society of Women Engineer <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.swe.org/scholarships/brochure.aspx\">scholarships</a> for female college and graduate students majoring in engineering or computer science.</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.nacme.org/NACME_B.aspx?pageid=102\">National Action Council For Minorities in Engineering (NACME) Scholarships</a> for minority engineering students enrolled at a partner university.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Graduate_school_scholarships_and_fellowship_programs\">Graduate school scholarships and fellowship programs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Engineering_scholarships&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Graduate school scholarships and fellowship programs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>American Nuclear Society <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ans.org/honors/scholarships/\">scholarships</a></li>\n<li>American Nuclear Society <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ans.org/honors/cfellowship/\">Fellowship</a></li>\n<li>American Society for Heating, Refrigerating and Air-Conditioning Engineers <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ashrae.org/students/page/704\">Scholarships and Grants</a></li>\n<li>American Society for Mechanical Engineers <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.asme.org/Education/College/FinancialAid/Scholarships.cfm\">scholarships</a></li>\n<li>American Society of Naval Engineers <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.navalengineers.org/awards/scholarships/Pages/ASNELandingPage.aspx\">scholarships</a></li>\n<li>Department of Energy <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.musc.edu/specialprograms/\">Nuclear Engineering and Health Physics Scholarship and Fellowship Program</a> (NOTE: Suspended as of 2008)</li>\n<li>National Defense Science and Engineering <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://ndseg.asee.org/\">fellowships</a></li>\n<li>National Society of Professional Engineers <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.nspe.org/Students/Resources/index.html\">scholarships and fellowships</a>.</li>\n<li>Wire Reinforcement Institute  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.wirereinforcementinstitute.org/\">scholarships</a> of up to &lt;dollar/&gt;10,000.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Engineering_scholarships&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Computer_science_and_technology_scholarships\" title=\"Computer science and technology scholarships\">Computer science and technology scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics,_science,_and_technology_scholarships\" title=\"Mathematics, science, and technology scholarships\">Mathematics, science, and technology scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_scholarships\" title=\"Academic scholarships\">Academic scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Engineering_internships&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Engineering internships (page does not exist)\">Engineering internships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Engineering_competitions\" title=\"Engineering competitions\">Engineering competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Engineering_summer_programs\" title=\"Engineering summer programs\">Engineering summer programs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Engineering_schools&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Engineering schools (page does not exist)\">Engineering schools</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018081324\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.024 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 18/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:1587:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018081324 and revision id 128399. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}